commit fba947ae77d65e57039030346690657ace257f9d
Author: Bernhard Suttner <suttner@atix.de>
Date:   Thu May 7 20:36:45 2026 +0200

    feat(actions/execution_environments): use first valid proxy with Ansible_Director feature
    
    Before this commit, proxy selection had two issues: it always selected
    the first available Smart Proxy, regardless of whether the Ansible_Director
    feature was available, and it could select a proxy that did not belong to
    the user's organization.
    
    With this change, the first Smart Proxy with the Ansible_Director feature
    is selected based on the current user and organization. The selected proxy
    is then passed through to the action.
    
    Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>

